{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "mpx16",
  "name": "Akai MPX16",
  "manufacturer": "Akai Professional",
  "notes": "16-pad sample player used as a button board. Physically the pads sit in two rows of eight (two 2x4 blocks side by side), matching the hardware photo and the v1 layout image - not a 4x4 grid. Pad N sends note 111+N (112-127), as in the v1 mapping. led is 'on-off': the pads are LED-backlit and the v1 file ships a buttonFeedbackMapper (On=127/Off=0), i.e. v1 actively sent note feedback to this board.",
